{"repositoryId":1245084237,"availability":"available","full":"nikolas4175-godaddy/baton","name":"baton","description":"A workflow orchestration plugin for the WordPress Abilities API","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-20T22:31:47Z","updated":"2026-05-29T22:34:35Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://playground.wordpress.net/?blueprint-url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fnikolas4175-godaddy%2Fbaton%2Fmain%2Fblueprint.json","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.261Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.261Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.261Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.261Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A conductor’s wand, properly called a baton, is a thin, lightweight stick used by music directors to amplify and guide physical gestures.","Baton is a WordPress plugin that adds a thin, lightweight layer used by admins to orchestrate site workflows based on the WP Abilities API. It provides field-level input mapping to control data passing between registered Abilities, and each workflow is also exposed as it's own Ability (baton/workflow-{id}) for nesting or use in external tooling."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikolas4175-godaddy/baton/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"17a432ffdbb65645e08447230c28981dafb85273472db269a8e80181a249092f","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.384Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:05.384Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A conductor’s wand, properly called a baton, is a thin, lightweight stick used by music directors to amplify and guide physical gestures.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikolas4175-godaddy/baton/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"17a432ffdbb65645e08447230c28981dafb85273472db269a8e80181a249092f","sourceUrl":"https://github